  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.2.0 - Added Response Patterns and Exceptions:\n      • Added ApiResponse<T> for standardized API responses\n      • Added PagedResponse<T> for paginated data\n      • Added ValidationResponse for validation errors\n      • Added standard exceptions (BusinessException, NotFoundException, UnauthorizedException, ValidationException, ConflictException)\n      • Improved error handling patterns\n\n      Version 0.1.0 - Initial Release:\n      • Universal base entities (BaseEntity, AuditableEntity, UserTrackedEntity, DomainEntity, UserOwnedEntity)\n      • Automatic audit trail with AuditInterceptor\n      • Built-in soft delete functionality\n      • Entity state management and locking\n      • Multi-tenant support with UserOwnedEntity\n      • Framework-agnostic design with minimal dependencies\n      • Full Entity Framework Core integration\n      • Comprehensive documentation and examples",
